on mouseUp
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 29 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [  4] getglobal 32 ............................ <objectxx>
  [  7] pushint16 13 ............................ <13>
  [ 10] set 6 ................................... set the locH of sprite the clickOn to objectxx
  [ 12] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 14] thebuiltin 29 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [ 16] getglobal 33 ............................ <objectyy>
  [ 19] pushint16 14 ............................ <14>
  [ 22] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite the clickOn to objectyy
  [ 24] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 26] extcall 34 .............................. updateStage()
  [ 29] ret
end

on mouseDown
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 29 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [  4] pushint16 13 ............................ <13>
  [  7] get 6 ................................... <the locH of sprite the clickOn>
  [  9] setglobal 32 ............................ objectxx = the locH of sprite the clickOn
  [ 12] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [ 14] thebuiltin 29 ........................... <the clickOn>
  [ 16] pushint16 14 ............................ <14>
  [ 19] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite the clickOn>
  [ 21] setglobal 33 ............................ objectyy = the locV of sprite the clickOn
  [ 24] ret
end
